{"id":"n62357-2-4","stage":2,"title":"오가다 · 来去","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62357-2-4-1","ko":"누가 산에 이렇게 쓰레기를 버렸을까?","zh":"会是谁把垃圾扔到山里的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁（询问人）","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"산에","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산에","audio":"/audio/e15e1da2e3c81b9f81cf.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"이렇게：“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71156","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰레기를","meaning":"垃圾","explanation":"쓰레기：垃圾；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"쓰레기","audio":"/audio/2a2c538e4d404f05e7c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29590","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰레기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰레기를","audio":"/audio/afb5dd72ec377c4367a5.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸을까?","meaning":"扔，丢","explanation":"버리다：扔，丢；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸을까","audio":"/audio/40955155ede72959cb7e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"谁","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"